---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Artists | Time Share Radio" description="Put your next release in the spotlight with Time Share Radio.">
  <section class="page-hero artist-hero"><span class="section-num">FOR INDEPENDENT ARTISTS</span><h1>THIS IS<br /><em>YOUR TIME.</em></h1><p>Give your release a room of its own. Time Share Radio helps independent artists turn a song into a focused listening moment.</p></section>
  <section class="artist-offer">
    <div class="offer-card"><span class="tag">ARTIST SPOTLIGHT</span><h2>One song.<br />One focused feature.</h2><ul><li>Dedicated placement for your selected track</li><li>Artist name, artwork, and release details</li><li>A shareable moment built for your audience</li><li>Simple one-time checkout</li></ul><div class="price"><small>SPOTLIGHT ACCESS</small><strong>$19.99</strong></div><a class="button primary" href="https://www.paypal.com/ncp/payment/2DSWELQCG67ZG">Reserve your time <b>↗</b></a></div>
    <div class="artist-note"><span class="section-num">WHY TIME SHARE</span><blockquote>“Attention is the rarest currency in music. We built a place where artists can actually hold it.”</blockquote><p>Submit after checkout. We’ll follow up for your track, cover art, artist name, and release links.</p></div>
  </section>
</Layout>
